    "source": "architecture \"From strategy to delivery\" {\n  description \"Capabilities, processes, applications, and technology in one shared model.\"\n  model {\n    package business \"Business architecture\" {\n      capability sales \"Digital sales\" { description \"Turn interest into lasting customer value.\" }\n      process checkout \"Order to cash\" { description \"A traceable end-to-end business process.\" }\n    }\n    package applications \"Application architecture\" {\n      application shop \"Commerce platform\" { technology \"Web · Mobile\" }\n      component pricing \"Pricing engine\" { technology \"Rules service\" }\n      interface api \"Partner interface\" { technology \"OpenAPI 3.1\" }\n    }\n    package technology \"Technology architecture\" {\n      node runtime \"Container runtime\" { technology \"Kubernetes\" }\n      database records \"Operational data\" { technology \"PostgreSQL\" }\n      artifact contract \"API contract\" { technology \"Versioned specification\" }\n    }\n    relation enables sales -> checkout \"Enables\" { type association }\n    relation supports shop -> checkout \"Realizes\" { type realization }\n    relation composes shop -> pricing \"Contains\" { type composition }\n    relation exposes shop -> api \"Exposes\"\n    relation deployed shop -> runtime \"Deploys on\" { type dependency }\n    relation access pricing -> records \"Reads rules\" { type access }\n    relation defines contract -> api \"Defines\" { type realization }\n  }\n  view layers \"Architecture layers\" {\n    direction down\n    spacing 90\n    route supports { from top; to bottom; curve bezier }\n    route deployed { curve rounded }\n    route access { curve rounded }\n  }\n  view dark \"Night view\" {\n    direction right\n    theme dark\n    spacing 80\n  }\n}\n"
